  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience the perfect blend of comfort, durability, and agility with Rothco's Tactical 10-8 Lightweight Field Pants. Crafted from a lightweight cotton, polyester, and spandex ripstop woven fabric, these pants offer the flexibility needed for a wide range of motions while ensuring durability to withstand rugged conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "7",
  "description": "<p>Experience the perfect blend of comfort, durability, and agility with Rothco's Tactical 10-8 Lightweight Field Pants. Crafted from a lightweight cotton, polyester, and spandex ripstop woven fabric, these pants offer the flexibility needed for a wide range of motions while ensuring durability to withstand rugged conditions. The gusseted crotch design enhances mobility, allowing you to move freely in any situation, while the self-adjusting comfort waistband provides a customizable fit for optimal comfort during extended wear. With 4 cargo pockets featuring hook and loop closures (2 on each leg and 2 in the back), these pants offer ample storage space for your essentials. The side cargo pockets are equipped with internal elastic straps designed to securely your equipment, providing convenient access to your gear when you need it most. Additionally, 2 front slash pockets offer additional storage for small items. Designed for versatility, these pants feature front belt loops suitable for various belt types, including BDU, riggers, or garrison belts. The zipper fly and hidden snap button closure ensure a secure fit and easy on/off. Whether you're navigating challenging terrain or tackling everyday tasks, Rothco's Tactical 10-8 Lightweight Field Pants are the perfect choice for those who demand comfort, durability, and performance in their apparel.</p>",
